r=Path('Code1/STAGING_LEDGER.md'); u=r.read_text().replace('`E280..E35F` excluding padding and integrated ranges | 224 | `E280` installs INT 24h with extender-specific behavior. `E2C3..E35F` is an IRET trampoline and must remain a machine/interrupt boundary, never an ordinary host callback. `E0D0..E173` is now directly reconciled and integrated, along with the constructors, three 7240 wrappers, and `E360..E3B2`.','`E2C3..E35F` | 157 | Full interrupt trampoline: saves ES/DS and the complete general-register image, calls CEC0, switches SS:ESP to the runtime interrupt stack, far-calls the callback saved at 5102:5106, restores the prior stack with LSS, restores runtime stack metadata and registers, then IRET. It must remain a machine/interrupt boundary, never an ordinary host callback. `E280..E2C2` is now directly reconciled and integrated as the vector installer.')
